{"title":"1997 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> of integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec893ca22ac75b59090381fcab8cabf89996e7c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" /> that satisfy the equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca52d6e964ae3881baf3de57e2a20d671aae770a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b^{2}}=b^{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/8656817566f89750cb1144c7678d1a9041e63794.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 \\le a \\le b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/d/7dd6f7bf66f80983bae4d0ca677ef43c2dc7db89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^{b})^{b}=b^{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>Looking at this expression since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/c/5cca02ec1ba7ed4082e5c7ee294a71b48192fc5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\ge a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/378823377f9d51b77bc583ba124208d201dce9d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b} \\le b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Here we look at subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8726d98aced2f3140dd77a2d8614c2e7674700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/093b01b7d3700ce10cfbcb427ccb7b8949ca7ea8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b}&gt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/d/e5d5c573a1c558c1105556e21bfd6097221fcb14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 &lt; a \\le b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" />.  This contradicts condition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/378823377f9d51b77bc583ba124208d201dce9d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b} \\le b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can't be more than one giving the solution of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc335af40586292a7ea56ec38e63f8010bd42050.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />.  So we substitute the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> into the original equation to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0b2ef6ecedf0adca82f538b750cfbbc593ccdd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^{b^2}=b^{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\" /> which solves to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and our first pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7f31d91ef7804079a6343d10d3a80cccd445f02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><br />\nCase 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44dfe67e7957bd3c3c4f5a649c4712247410a127.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 \\le b &lt; a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7b001777ec126cb2582b19b9f6882ca4a0d285.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b^2}=b^{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/2/082852571ecc48ed136ba13dcffa8f6e40064bbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/e/b6ef6254c6c47f0d940e4684d436ecc384bb5ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{2}&lt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" /> and we multiply both sides of the equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec26825206869aee1e1801fd471d218f536120c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{-2b^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" /> to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/c/cac2cc7f0bfa8275b79b71fb401b3f8042e02659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{-2b^{2}}a^{b^2}=b^{-2b^{2}}b^{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa7a72151e4468de63c82178cdf01af99ff6e087.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(ab^{-2})^{b^{2}}=b^{a-2b^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"134\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/e/b6ef6254c6c47f0d940e4684d436ecc384bb5ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{2}&lt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12e768e32c48600058c5663179350ac3944c4a4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(ab^{-2})^{b^{2}}&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"24\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/e/2be77a1d305d5a824855e6785ee2427a05057c07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{a-2b^{2}}&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"21\" />. This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/063080782087740ef13e966334ec19bd75b2fa7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-2b^{2}&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/5/f75c29aa31c0b31d10948edb929c506241c2547f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;2b^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/40920163c12ad9f3ce69942d9b625b88ac82923f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/c/11c0e2593d7c0841c90727ac20963dc6a458df48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=kb^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/8/9c8862e160e003fecbf92593383a70e4be86a9e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\in \\mathbb{Z} ^{+}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/5/f75c29aa31c0b31d10948edb929c506241c2547f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;2b^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5bb76208dae30e44513fa10ff49ba1329094713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6ff7715c8021a3bd4887027862792e8d17ca07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(kb^{2}b^{-2})^{b^{2}}=b^{kb^{2}-2b^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/9/9f97c9a8a55682d89a8528060d0e982b341a1949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{b^{2}}=b^{(k-2)b^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/0146448c26e3ae95bedb342453f758cfd921f3eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=b^{k-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"17\" />, which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/a/deaafc323a7c5d30868997112ec73d21909d5500.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p>subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/3359f43f0fd0ed3b672d389374aecd0360921a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/4/d947bad84c5b3fe6dfefed2da81bf2505f05383c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=b^{3-2}=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c32fddf44c7d5f2f13e1017582bdee1772a95581.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=kb^{2}=(3)(3)^{2}=27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"182\" height=\"21\" />. which provides 2nd pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/2/8f206f6bd6f29fc725d498a02a33fdcfe5e855cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(27,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eeae143c5c9dbd376ffa1ffa8bdb93a58e8c9889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a0b75553e873632ceab6e064998464f6b10ccb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4=b^{4-2}=b^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"17\" />, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/d/dbd205bbf21adfb5c0deec858c95009b0abed8d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=kb^{2}=(4)(2)^{2}=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"182\" height=\"21\" />. which provides 3rd pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/b/08b20d2bd69d33e2bfd3b9f83de7afad8cd2061f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(16,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7acd996458847e72aae43c63dee726850d1dd5f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/0146448c26e3ae95bedb342453f758cfd921f3eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=b^{k-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"17\" />, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/b/77b76b5e1014916e793c91cb767c141089854662.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=k^{1/(k-2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> which decreases with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/1/551aef3a8b2ea9ea85d1ef64244d957c3658bda1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\to 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/6/9e6d2f81b2737f052327b94fbf1121a99486c0bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\to \\infty$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> .  From subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eeae143c5c9dbd376ffa1ffa8bdb93a58e8c9889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, thus for subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7acd996458847e72aae43c63dee726850d1dd5f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/7/4d79ff4da333987739711fc14615e33462c100fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;b&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />.  Therefore this subcase has no solution because it contradicts the condition for Case 2 of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/a/deaafc323a7c5d30868997112ec73d21909d5500.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Final solution for all pairs is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e7488563ad791f5542988fddffea6562c9b131c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(1,1); (27,3); (16,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"221\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>~ Tomas Diaz. orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO\" title=\"1997 IMO\">1997 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1997 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190630\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 342/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1238/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10878/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.532      1 -total\n 55.60%    6.968      1 Template:IMO_box\n 43.25%    5.420      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25398:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190630 and revision id 204263. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}